6) Check risk R-sum and trade attribution: ratio should use PREORDER planned ATR stop points and ACTUAL qty, not absent trades.csv 'stop_distance' column silently giving null. If needed join by strategy captured entry metadata and record B2 trade-level risk/qty evidence, not a fabricated posthoc 'native' trade. Check costed vs zero-cost path differences, no false implied fee reconciliation.
7) Verify exact task done: phase2 source integrity, phase3 causal event study with latest B0, phase4 full-history native B2 costed/zero-cost annual runs 2013-2026, all years completed, net PnL, trade count, profit factor, daily cash risk, 2026 STOP rate actual native stop order, B0 comparison, launch-date split; no selected/optimized parameter trial. Phase5/6/7 not user-approved. If initial Codex stopped early or year failed, continue native run with process-safe tmux and log/ledger, do not just plan. Keep outputs in existing phase234 path with independent_review.md; tests and git diff --check.
8) If result remains uncertain, mark INCONCLUSIVE and tell ChatGPT. No false verified live trading.
