The costed case completed 5,459 trades with **−$143,121.29 net P&L**; the zero-cost case returned **+$308,023.53**. The audit reconciled fills, trade P&L, fees, daily equity, and the two-entry daily cap across all 28 annual shards. The focused tests passed **8/8**.

The source and frozen archive hashes were verified. The preregistered spec remains intact; the documentation-only CME reference amendment is recorded. The protected promotion was not changed, and no commit, push, or live order was made.

