codex
I found a real B2 accounting error: one 2024 trade used 18 MNQ contracts with a recorded 44-point stop, which implies $1,584 nominal risk. Its planned quantity and captured stop metadata do not match. I’ll preserve that 2024 run as a failed attribution attempt, bind ATR stop metadata to each submitted native entry order, and rerun the same frozen 2024 B2 cases. This is a repair to the registered trial, not a new variant.
