codex
A second audit found annual-shard contamination: the Engine processes the 14-day ATR warmup window, and the strategy can trade during that window. The reported per-year trade ledger filters those trades out, but the saved equity path and final engine value still include them. I’m preserving the current shard outputs, disabling orders before each shard’s session-year, and rerunning the same two frozen cases for all 14 years. This is required for clean annual cash-risk and equity accounting.
