codex
All 14 annual runs are complete and their ledgers reconcile internally. The independent checks found two unresolved limits: six entry fills landed in a later session-year than their shard, with one duplicated across shards; and tick rounding from the actual off-tick fill made the protective stop risk exceed $1,000 on 137 trades, up to $1,036.45. The size formula itself matched on the evaluated trades. I’m recording these limits and finishing the artifact-backed report as inconclusive.
