Completed the independent review in [the audit report](/home/quant/dev/quant/quant-research/docs/audit/one_bar_nq_stop_scaling_phase234_20261012.md) and [the phase 2–4 review record](/home/quant/dev/quant/quant-research/run_log/one_bar_nq_stop_scaling_20261012/phase234/independent_review.md).

The corrected B0 baseline has 5,462 trades. I repaired Phase 3’s baseline source and trade-to-fill attribution, and fixed B2 entry metadata matching. All 14 annual shards ran for both registered B2 cost cases. Native trade/fill accounting checks passed, but annual isolation remains inconclusive: six entries filled outside their shard year, including one duplicated across adjacent shards. The review preserves the original frozen promoted package and records no new variants.

The focused test file passed: **10 tests**. The full repository test suite did not complete cleanly; its parallel run showed two failures before interruption, and a serial run was interrupted without a result.

**Skipped:** a clean rerun of the full repository test suite. **Risk:** annual B2 cash-risk figures are contaminated by cross-year fills; the findings remain exploratory and are not live approval.
